activity Request Return
activity Approve Return
activity Generate Return Label
activity Ship Item Back
activity Receive Item
activity Inspect Item
activity Determine Refund
activity Process Refund
activity Restock Item
activity Dispose Item
bind Request Return: Return Status, Return Reason, Return ID
bind Approve Return: Return Status
bind Ship Item Back: Return Status, Days to Return, Shipping Method, Shipping Cost
bind Receive Item: Return Status
bind Inspect Item: Return Status, Item Condition, Inspection Result
bind Determine Refund: Return Status, Refund Amount
bind Process Refund: Return Status, Refund Amount
bind Restock Item: Return Status, Restock Quantity
bind Dispose Item: Return Status
Return Status: Requested, Approved, Rejected, Shipped, Received, Inspected, Refunded, Restocked, Disposed
Item Condition: integer between 1 and 5
Refund Amount: float between 0.0 and 1000.0
Days to Return: integer between 1 and 60
Return Reason: Defective, Damaged, Wrong Item, No Longer Needed
Inspection Result: Acceptable, Damaged, Unacceptable
Restock Quantity: integer between 1 and 100
Shipping Cost: float between 0.0 and 50.0
Shipping Method: UPS, FedEx, USPS
Return ID: integer between 1000 and 9999
Init[Request Return] |A.Return Status is Requested |
End[Process Refund] | |
End[Restock Item] | |
End[Dispose Item] | |
Existence[Inspect Item] | |
Absence2[Dispose Item] | |
Exactly[Determine Refund] |A.Return Status is Refunded |
Responded Existence[Process Refund, Determine Refund] | | |
Precedence[Request Return, Approve Return] |A.Return Status is Requested | |
Precedence[Generate Return Label, Ship Item Back] | | |
Precedence[Inspect Item, Determine Refund] |A.Inspection Result is Acceptable OR A.Inspection Result is Damaged | |
Response[Approve Return, Generate Return Label] |A.Return Status is Approved | |
Response[Receive Item, Inspect Item] |A.Return Status is Received | |
Response[Inspect Item, Restock Item] |A.Inspection Result is Acceptable | |
Succession[Ship Item Back, Receive Item] |A.Return Status is Shipped |T.Return Status is Received |
Alternate Precedence[Determine Refund, Process Refund] | | |
Alternate Response[Inspect Item, Determine Refund] | | |
Chain Response[Determine Refund, Process Refund] |A.Return Status is Refunded |A.Refund Amount == T.Refund Amount |
Chain Precedence[Inspect Item, Restock Item] |A.Inspection Result is Acceptable | |
Co-Existence[Inspect Item, Determine Refund] | | |
Choice[Restock Item, Dispose Item] | | |
Exclusive Choice[Restock Item, Dispose Item] | | |
Not Co-Existence[Restock Item, Dispose Item] | | |
Not Responded Existence[Dispose Item, Restock Item] | | |
Not Precedence[Inspect Item, Process Refund] | | |
Not Response[Dispose Item, Process Refund] | |T.Return Reason is No Longer Needed |
Not Succession[Dispose Item, Restock Item] | | |
Not Chain Precedence[Restock Item, Dispose Item] | | |
Not Chain Response[Request Return, Process Refund] | | |
Not Chain Succession[Approve Return, Dispose Item] | | |